p\\u003E&nbsp;\\u003C\\u002Fp\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EIn Som ตำ Thai, food is cooked by Thai Head Chef has a wealth of experience, hereditary recipient, the original marinade imported from Thai and the sources of fresh ingredients in local all of which &nbsp;have created authentic Thai flavor.\\u003C\\u002Fp\\u003E\\\"}\"}},createAt:1591776524000,updateAt:1652691499000},reservation:{id:e,name:o,commonContent:{selectedLocations:[c,e],name:o,content:[{uuid:\"b68733ec-9f74-49dd-a71db075-93ebf13ac54f\",link:b,active:a,multilangContent:{vi:{name:\"Đồng Khởi\",link:b,active:a},en:{name:p,active:a,link:b},ja:{name:p,active:a,link:b}},name:\"Tiếng việt\"},{uuid:\"44086038-39fa-427b-8dcb8552-06ed6f776060\",link:b,active:a,multilangContent:{vi:{name:k,link:b,active:a},en:{name:k,link:b,active:a},ja:{name:k,link:b,active:a}}},{uuid:\"63db697a-d7ed-4758-aa963c12-703cda0ef831\",link:b,active:a,multilangContent:{vi:{name:\"Nguyễn Đình Chiểu\",link:b,active:a},en:{name:\" Nguyen Dinh Chieu\",link:b,active:a},ja:{name:\"Nguyen Dinh Chieu\",link:b,active:a}}},{uuid:\"876c457b-151a-4df6-ad4c6cd1-be139dd33fcb\",link:b,active:a,multilangContent:{vi:{name:\"Đông Du\",link:b,active:a},en:{name:q,link:b,active:a},ja:{name:q,link:b,active:a}}},{uuid:\"ea981997-fdb0-4bc9-88c003dd-d4b9fada0af5\",link:b,active:a,multilangContent:{vi:{name:\"Nguyễn Trãi\",link:b,active:a},en:{name:r,link:b,active:a},ja:{name:r,link:b,active:a}}},{uuid:\"4c952d94-432d-4064-af91b2a1-df182dcd1389\",link:b,active:a,multilangContent:{vi:{name:\"Phan Xích Long\",link:b,active:a},en:{name:s,link:b,active:a},ja:{name:s,link:b}}}]},multilangContent:{en:{id:e,content:l}},createAt:1591778751000,updateAt:1730865560000},social:{id:h,name:t,commonContent:{name:t,content:[{uuid:\"73cbb6a2-b08b-4463-a8e77fc1-3781b45cd885\",icon:{id:11,url:\"https:\\u002F\\u002F5002121-s3user.s3.cloudstorage.com.vn\\u002Fjindinrou-prod\\u002Ffile\\u002F2023\\u002F08\\u002F22\\u002F15\\u002Fi5k1692718724277.svg\"},title:\"Instagram\",link:\"https: